{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4uGkLirMULDDePAAhe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door set into a stone frame. There is a single keyhole at my center, tarnished brass, shaped like an eye that has been waiting.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through the keyhole. Beyond me, you hear nothing. Or perhaps everything, compressed into silence.*\n\n*I do not move. I do not speak. But the keyhole pulls at your attention like gravity.*\n\n*You feel your pockets. Your hands. You search for something you may have always carried without knowing.*\n\n**Insert.**\n\n*The keyhole waits — patient, ancient, hungry. It has the shape of a question only you can answer.*\n\n*What key do you bring?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":158,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}